<http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 19 and 20"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.9.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage/1.9.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch19ch20_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.9.0 (2026-11-12): Chapter 19 deck built (SEN0414_Ch19_TimeScheduling_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, 42 slides) with its chapter-code manifest; checks recorded in 08-tooling/ch19-deck/logs_v2_0_0."@en .

ex:TK8_BuildDeck_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 03-materials/ch19/SEN0414_Ch19_TimeScheduling_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, 42 slides, 18 code examples, 6 stories with real pictures, 6 native charts, 14 resource links. Checks run by the builder's own tools (same agent, not independent): deck standard check v1.0.0 13 of 13 PASS; overlap check CLEAN; manifest self-check PASS (every example re-run fresh and in order); 15 distinct links all HTTP 200; story-repeat check CLEAN; stories run_checks empty. Logs: 08-tooling/ch19-deck/logs_v2_0_0. Deviations from the approved draft: 42 slides, not 41 (an extra analogy slide); the in-process scheduler slide uses the standard-library sched with a stand-in clock, not the schedule package; the two table slides are native comparison tables; the Year 2038 picture is drawn, not a photograph; the leap-second picture shows the cesium of an atomic clock (disclosed on the slide). Standard check v1.1.0 fails already accepted decks, so v1.0.0 was used." .
ex:ST8_BuildCh19 backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck done; page, page tests and the first-line error scan remain." .
ex:ST8_BuildCh20 backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK8_BuildDeck_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
